                                "sense_id": "acc2a0f6-bc8d-34ec-8791-423628012537",
                                "text": "And farther, that being fitted to each other on their flat sides, alternate male and female (see drawing annexed), by means of the shoulderings or wedgewise-securings, and abutments, which will be better and more clearly understood by a view of the drawings annexed to these presents, and to which we hereafter particularly refer;"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "03ff13ae-2bfb-4639-88b3-0f78d4f2ad77",
                                "sense_id": "acc2a0f6-bc8d-34ec-8791-423628012537",
                                "text": "Furthermore the shoulderings which were put outside the wheels to prevent them from slipping off the axles, are the proclamations of the prophets which lend weight to the evangelical and apostolic writing lest it should be doubted by any of its readers."
                            }
                        ]
